/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and August to September came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them, same as October to November. In 2025, the middle ran 278% of normal in March to April and 31% of normal in September to October. Grid 16621 had its driest year in 2011, at 36% of normal.</p>"}
